@startuml
!include _astyle.iuml
title 5.6  Sub-Contractor / Vendor Selection & Reassessment (QP.34) — Activity
|Applicant|
start
:Submit application / recommendation;
|Purchasing / Production|
:Verify & assess capability (F228);
|QAD|
:(Optional) site audit; evaluate QMS;
|Purchasing / Production|
:Table evaluation to JTP;
|JTP / MD|
:Select, rate & approve (min 3);
if (Approved?) then (no)
  |Purchasing / Production|
  :No further action;
  stop
else (yes)
  |Purchasing / Production|
  :Register in AVL / MSN / F229;
  :Issue PO (F312) for services / OV;
  |Sub-Contractor|
  :Return repaired items to Central Stores;
  |Purchasing / Production|
  :Receiving inspection (QP.15 / QP.52);
  :Reassess performance every 3 years (F230);
  if (Not Suitable & 2nd CAR?) then (yes)
    :Deregister from AVL / MSN / F229;
  else (no)
    :Retain on lists;
  endif
  stop
endif
@enduml
